              "rules_text_html": [
                "<p><strong>Mentor</strong> <em>(You may only have The Librarian in your deck if your hero is young.)</em></p>\n<p>At the start of your turn, if The Librarian is face down in your arsenal, you may turn him face up.</p>\n<p><strong>Once per Turn Effect -</strong> Whenever you create a Spectral Shield token, draw a card and put a lesson counter on The Librarian. Then if there are 3 or more lesson counters on The Librarian, banish him, search your deck a <strong>specialization</strong> card, put it face up into your arsenal, and shuffle your deck.</p>\n"
